#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:919
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The account is the identity, the profile is the face in a group"
msgstr "Nalog je identitet, profil je lice u grupi"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:776
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The app"
msgstr "Aplikacija"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:427
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The basic unit of Potok. One model covers the root, ordinary groups and sub-groups, direct conversations and threads. Exactly one group is the root, and every other has a parent and a creator."
msgstr "Osnovna jedinica Potoka. Isti model pokriva koren, obične grupe i podgrupe, direktne razgovore i niti. Tačno jedna grupa je koren, a svaka druga ima roditelja i autora."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:470
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The content of a group. In a conversation it is a message, and as data of an app it does not appear in the conversation. A value can reply to another value, and a thread opened from a value is a group that points back at it."
msgstr "Sadržaj grupe. U razgovoru je to poruka, a kao podatak aplikacije ne pojavljuje se u razgovoru. Vrednost može da bude odgovor na drugu vrednost, a nit otvorena iz vrednosti je grupa koja pokazuje nazad na nju."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:675
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The core of the domain: an account uses profiles, a profile is a member of groups, a group contains values, and a value opens a thread, which is a group again."
msgstr "Jezgro domena: nalog koristi profile, profil je član grupa, grupa sadrži vrednosti, a vrednost otvara nit koja je opet grupa."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:905
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The data of an app goes with its description, and it can be deleted from the group's settings."
msgstr "Podaci aplikacije nestaju sa njenim opisom, a mogu da se obrišu i iz podešavanja grupe."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:956
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The default description and every <GroupAltDescription>alternative description</GroupAltDescription> can be an app. Its data are <Value>values</Value> marked as data, and each of them knows which app it belongs to. A composite key holds them in the same group, and deleting an alternative description deletes its data too."
msgstr "Podrazumevani opis i svaki <GroupAltDescription>alternativni opis</GroupAltDescription> mogu da budu aplikacija. Njeni podaci su <Value>vrednosti</Value> označene kao podaci, a svaka zna kojoj aplikaciji pripada. Složeni ključ ih drži u istoj grupi, a brisanje alternativnog opisa briše i njegove podatke."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:735
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The diagram scrolls left and right."
msgstr "Dijagram se pomera levo i desno."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:605
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The end is not before the start."
msgstr "Kraj nije pre početka."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:940
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The group's <GroupManifest>manifest</GroupManifest> applies or, if it has none, that of its nearest ancestor. Every member has `everyone`, so that <GroupRole>role</GroupRole> is not stored, and `admin` has everything. With the other roles a permission holds when at least one allows it and none denies it. `everyone` can only allow. A <GroupReaction>reaction to a group</GroupReaction> also reaches past the members: while `everyone` may react, so may a signed-in profile that is not a member of a public group."
msgstr "Važi <GroupManifest>manifest</GroupManifest> grupe ili, ako ga nema, manifest najbližeg pretka. Svaki član ima `everyone`, pa se ta <GroupRole>uloga</GroupRole> ne upisuje, a `admin` ima sve. Kod ostalih uloga dozvola važi kad je bar jedna dozvoli i nijedna ne zabrani. `everyone` može samo da dozvoli. <GroupReaction>Reakcija na grupu</GroupReaction> ide i van članova: dok `everyone` sme da reaguje, sme i prijavljen profil koji nije član javne grupe."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:778
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The group's values"
msgstr "Vrednosti grupe"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:609
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The repeat interval is from 1 to 99."
msgstr "Interval ponavljanja je od 1 do 99."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:599
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The role `everyone` is not written here."
msgstr "Uloga `everyone` se ne upisuje."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:591
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The root and direct groups do not inherit members."
msgstr "Koren i direktne grupe ne nasleđuju članove."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:583
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The root has no creator, every other group does."
msgstr "Koren nema autora, a svaka druga grupa ima."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:579
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The root has no parent, every other group does."
msgstr "Koren nema roditelja, a svaka druga grupa ima."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:576
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The root is not public."
msgstr "Koren nije javan."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:888
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The server checks every call again, whatever the app asks for."
msgstr "Server ponovo proverava svaki poziv, šta god aplikacija tražila."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:434
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The set of roles of a group. A group without its own manifest uses that of its nearest ancestor that has one. The root always has one."
msgstr "Skup uloga jedne grupe. Grupa bez svog manifesta koristi manifest najbližeg pretka koji ga ima. Koren ga uvek ima."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:613
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The size is not negative."
msgstr "Veličina nije negativna."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:747
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "These keys do not let a row be deleted while something uses it. The others delete the dependent rows or clear the field."
