#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:622
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "writes"
msgstr "piše"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:893
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Below its group it sees only what the viewer sees, and no further than one level under a direct sub-group."
msgstr "Ispod svoje grupe vidi samo ono što vidi i gledalac, i to najviše jedan nivo ispod direktne podgrupe."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:813
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "It can list the <Group>groups</Group> under one of its sub-groups, all of them or those of a chosen period, show their descriptions and take the viewer to their chat or their page. A link can open it on one of those groups. That is how a group becomes a news feed, with one story in each group."
msgstr "Može da izlista <Group>grupe</Group> ispod neke svoje podgrupe, sve ili one iz izabranog perioda, prikaže njihove opise i odvede gledaoca u njihov chat ili na njihovu stranu. Link može da je otvori baš na jednoj od tih grupa. Tako grupa postaje feed vesti, a svaka vest je jedna grupa."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:811
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Reads the groups below it"
msgstr "Čita grupe ispod sebe"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:831
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "For a viewer who may edit its group, an app can make <Group>groups</Group> right under it, change them and take them back. That is how one app writes what another shows, and a feed gets its editors' desk."
msgstr "Za gledaoca koji sme da menja njenu grupu, aplikacija pravi <Group>grupe</Group> odmah ispod sebe, menja ih i povlači. Tako jedna aplikacija piše ono što druga prikazuje, a feed dobija uredništvo."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:897
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "It writes to groups only for a viewer who may edit its own group, only right under it, and it neither deletes a group nor makes one an app."
msgstr "U grupe piše samo za gledaoca koji sme da menja njenu grupu, samo odmah ispod sebe, i ne može da obriše grupu ni da od nje napravi aplikaciju."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:829
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Keeps the groups below it"
msgstr "Vodi grupe ispod sebe"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:185
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "published at"
msgstr "vreme objave"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:901
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A reaction is the exception: an app adds it for any viewer who may react, only to a group below it, and the viewer can take it back."
msgstr "Izuzetak je reakcija: aplikacija je dodaje za svakog gledaoca koji sme da reaguje, samo na grupu ispod sebe, a gledalac može da je skloni."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:491
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An emoji of one profile on a group, as on a story in a news feed. A profile cannot use the same emoji twice on the same group."
msgstr "Reakcija jednog profila na grupu, na primer na vest u feedu. Isti profil ne može dvaput istim emodžijem na istu grupu."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:822
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "For each <Group>group</Group> below it, it gets the number of messages in its chat and its <GroupReaction>reactions</GroupReaction>. It can add the viewer's reaction and open the sharing of the group's link. That is how a story in a feed gets comments, reactions and a share button."
msgstr "Za svaku <Group>grupu</Group> ispod sebe dobija broj poruka u chatu i <GroupReaction>reakcije</GroupReaction>. Može da doda reakciju gledaoca i otvori deljenje linka grupe. Tako vest u feedu dobija komentare, reakcije i dugme za deljenje."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:820
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Gathers reactions and comments"
msgstr "Skuplja reakcije i komentare"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:367
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Group reaction"
msgstr "Reakcija na grupu"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:964
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A picture a description's template takes from the device is a <Value>value</Value> in the group's chat with its <ValueAttachment>file</ValueAttachment>, so it stays among the group's files. More people see a description than a chat, so the picture's address is signed and needs no login. Deleting that value also removes the picture from the description."
msgstr "Sliku koju šablon opisa uzme sa uređaja čuva <Value>vrednost</Value> u chatu grupe, sa svojim <ValueAttachment>fajlom</ValueAttachment>, pa slika ostaje među fajlovima grupe. Opis vidi više ljudi nego chat, zato je adresa slike potpisana i ne traži prijavu. Brisanje te vrednosti uklanja sliku i iz opisa."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:962
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A picture in a description is a file in the chat"
msgstr "Slika u opisu je fajl u chatu"
